<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-24777] Performance statistics: wrong number of SQL query executions</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-24777</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Performance statistics shows wrong number of SQL query executions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Both in the HTML report created via build-report.sh and as output of print-statistics.sh.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;***&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The attached 3 sample .prf files demonstrates the problem (one good and two bad).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;All 3 files were obtained from the client node executing &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;single explain query&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the same select SQL query in 8 threads during 3 seconds via the Calcite engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;About 1000 queries were executed in each test. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;report.txt files were generated by the command:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;print-statistics.sh . --out report.txt --ops QUERY
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In good case all 1189 select query executions were shown in report. &lt;br/&gt;
In first bad case only 5 of 979 were shown.&lt;br/&gt;
And in second bad case none of the select queries were shown.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;***&lt;br/&gt;
Considering the size of .prf files they does contain the info about all queries.&lt;br/&gt;
But it can not be read for some reasons.&lt;/p&gt;



</description>
